WEBVTT

00:15:57.799 --> 00:16:00.674
Don't cry for me, Cupertino.

00:16:00.698 --> 00:16:02.020
(Laughter)

00:16:02.044 --> 00:16:04.976
The truth is, I never left you.

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:08.535
I know the ropes now,
know what the tricks are.

00:16:08.559 --> 00:16:11.976
I made a fortune over at Pixar.

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:13.039
(Laughter)

00:16:13.063 --> 00:16:15.714
Don't cry for me, Cupertino.

00:16:16.182 --> 00:16:19.495
I've still got the drive and vision.

00:16:19.519 --> 00:16:22.971
I still wear sandals in any weather.

00:16:22.995 --> 00:16:24.976
It's just that these days,

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:26.976
they're Gucci leather.

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:28.976
(Laughter)

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:35.908
(Applause)